    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Public Tender - Centre Hospitalier Régional de Belval (CHRB) Implementation of an AI assistance solution for hospital staff 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must let staff quickly access reliable, up-to-date information drawn from the authority's internal procedures, care protocols and HAS recommendations, applicable regulatory texts, and internal documents (guides, notes, reference frameworks, drug references)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In the Design phase, our will design an AI assistance solution that supports hospital staff in clinical and administrative activities, improves efficiency, and ensures data sovereignty, taking into account the client's requirements for supporting hospital staff in clinical and administrative activities, improving efficiency, and ensuring data sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Pilot will involve deploying an AI assistance solution that supports hospital staff in clinical and administrative activities, improves efficiency, and ensures data sovereignty in one or two departments, with a limited number of users, to test and refine an AI assistance solution that supports hospital staff in clinical and administrative activities, improves efficiency, and ensures data sovereignty." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This will help our identify and address any issues before scaling up to the entire hospital." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Generalisation will involve rolling out an AI assistance solution that supports hospital staff in clinical and administrative activities, improves efficiency, and ensures data sovereignty to all services, with the support of change management and staff training." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Throughout The project, our will ensure that our solution is hosted on a SecNumCloud-qualified infrastructure, guaranteeing data sovereignty and compliance with regulatory requirements. our partner, OuraneCloud, will provide the necessary hosting capabilities. our will also work closely with Ligeo Santé, our health-IT integrator partner, to ensure seamless integration with the entire hospital existing systems, including the electronic patient record (DPI) and hospital information system (SIH). our dedicated team, consisting of a project director, solution architect, engineers, data scientist, and security compliance lead, will work collaboratively to deliver an AI assistance solution that supports hospital staff in clinical and administrative activities, improves efficiency, and ensures data sovereignty. our will provide regular progress updates and ensure that the client is informed and involved throughout The project." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By following this structured approach, our are confident that our can deliver an effective AI assistance solution that meets the client's needs, improves efficiency, and ensures data sovereignty, all within the specified time frame and budget of €900,000 over 5 years." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message3> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client requires a response time below 2 seconds, high availability (99.9%), integration with existing systems such as hospital information systems (SIH) and electronic patient records (DPI), support for health interoperability standards like HL7 and FHIR, and hosting on sovereign infrastructure certified to the level required by the tender within the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For each requirement, state whether each requirement is FULLY COVERED, PARTIALLY COVERED, or NOT COVERED by our current technical stack, and describe the proposed architecture." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Based on the provided context, I can assess the coverage of each client requirement as follows: 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Response time below 2 seconds: FULLY COVERED our platform's performance metrics indicate that common single-document queries are below 2 seconds at p95 latency, which meets this requirement. 2." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message5> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The solution must contextualise The solution answers to the staff member's request. 3.2 Drafting assistance." ;
